{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "task-management-api-2024",
		"name": "Task Management API",
		"description": "Full-stack Task Management Platform - REST API Collection\n\n## Base URL\n```\nhttp://localhost:8000/api\n```\n\n## Authentication\nAll protected endpoints require Bearer Token in Authorization header.\n\n1. Login first to get the token\n2. Token is automatically stored in environment variable\n3. Use {{token}} in Authorization header for protected routes\n\n## Test Credentials\n| Role | Email | Password |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| Admin | admin@example.com | password |\n| Manager | manager@example.com | password |\n| User | john@example.com | password |",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8000/api",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
